---
/** Night street through an 85 mm lens: focus slider and aperture buttons. */
interface Props {
  print?: string;
}
const { print = '/photos/samples/summer-fireworks/01.jpg' } = Astro.props;
const stops = ['1.4', '2.8', '5.6'];
---
<figure class="demo">
  <div class="stage" data-demo="bokeh" data-print={print} data-slider="bokeh-focus" data-output="bokeh-dist" style="--fb: radial-gradient(circle at 28% 38%, rgba(255,184,106,.35), transparent 13%), radial-gradient(circle at 62% 30%, rgba(116,179,255,.3), transparent 11%), #05060b">
    <canvas aria-label="ピント位置と絞りで玉ボケが変わる夜の街のデモ"></canvas>
    <div class="hud">
      <div class="row"><span class="tag" data-readout>85mm · f/1.4 · ピント 3.0m</span></div>
      <div class="row">
        <div class="chips" role="group" aria-label="絞り">
          {stops.map((f) => <button class="chip" type="button" data-f={f} aria-pressed={f === '1.4' ? 'true' : 'false'}>f/{f}</button>)}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="controls">
    <label for="bokeh-focus">ピント位置</label>
    <input type="range" id="bokeh-focus" min="0" max="1000" step="1" value="380" />
    <output id="bokeh-dist" for="bokeh-focus">3.0m</output>
  </div>
  <figcaption class="hint">触らないでいると、ピントが写真 → 遠くの街 → 手前のイルミネーションの順に動きます。絞ると玉ボケが小さく、六角形になります（絞り羽根6枚のレンズ）。</figcaption>
</figure>

<script>
  import { mountStage } from '../../scripts/gl/stage';
  import { createBokeh } from '../../scripts/demos/bokeh';
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('.stage[data-demo="bokeh"]').forEach((el) => {
    mountStage(el, (renderer, stage) => createBokeh(renderer, stage, el.dataset.print ?? ''));
  });
</script>

<style>
  .demo {
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 10px;
  }
</style>
